        "desc": "We propose DualDiff3D, which employs two diffusion models to extract structure priors from low-quality rendered novel views and appearance priors from reference views, together with a reliability-enhanced Render-Refine-Optimize loop to improve 3D Gaussian Splatting reconstruction and novel view rendering from sparse views."
